      "Below the big number, a neutral line compares this pull with the last one, such as \u201c+8\u00a0% vs. last pull\u201d. When all fights fall on one day or two days in a row, History lines the pulls up one after another with their time. The fight picker puts fights in a row at the same place under one header, and Party shows the board first.",
      "On first start the app shows a tour: six short steps, from the log folder to \u201cReport a bug\u201d. You can skip it, and \u201cShow the tour\u201d in the settings brings it back, also in the browser.",
